삶의 결 - The Texture of Life.

Life isn’t meant to be understood, but felt.

In the midst of all the chaos and uncertainty, there is one thing that remains certain, the person you are beneath it all. Perhaps that is the texture of life: the quiet, imperfect, ever-changing layers that make us who we are.

